  "worked_solution": "The function $f(x)$ above is defined for values between $x=1$ and $x=4.$\n\n- Since there is a closed circle at $x=1,$ this point is included in the domain.\n\n- On the other hand, because there is an open circle at $x=4,$ this point is not included in the domain.\n\nTherefore, the domain of this function is\n\n$$\n1\\le x<4.\n$$\n\nUsing interval notation, we write this as\n\n$$\nx\\in [1,4).\n$$",
